{"id":"wundern","lemma":"wundern","pos":"verb","rank":3280,"glosses":["to surprise, to astonish (of sights, behaviors, outcomes)","to be surprised","to wonder, to consider something strange, to be confused"],"ipa":"/ˈvʊndɐn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/De-wundern.ogg/De-wundern.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"wundre","1p":"wundern","2s":"wunderst","2p":"wundert","3s":"wundert","3p":"wundern"},"preterite":{"1s":"wunderte","1p":"wunderten","2s":"wundertest","2p":"wundertet","3s":"wunderte","3p":"wunderten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe gewundert","1p":"haben gewundert","2s":"hast gewundert","2p":"habt gewundert","3s":"hat gewundert","3p":"haben gewundert"},"future":{"1s":"werde wundern","1p":"werden wundern","2s":"wirst wundern","2p":"werdet wundern","3s":"wird wundern","3p":"werden wundern"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"wundre","2p":"wundert"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde wundern","1p":"würden wundern","2s":"würdest wundern","2p":"würdet wundern","3s":"würde wundern","3p":"würden wundern"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"gewundert"},"examples":[{"text":"Das wundert mich.","en":"That surprises me.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Hat sich jemand gewundert?","en":"Was anyone surprised?","words":[{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"someone, somebody"},null]},{"text":"Es wunderte mich nicht, wenn das geschähe.","en":"It wouldn't surprise me if that happened.","words":[{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to occur","l":"geschehen"}]},{"text":"Das Unglaublichste an Wundern ist, dass sie geschehen.","en":"The most incredible thing about miracles is that they happen.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"unbelievably","l":"unglaublich"},{"g":"at / on"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to occur"}]},{"text":"Es wundert mich nicht, dass du die Antwort nicht weißt.","en":"I'm not surprised you don't know the answer.","words":[{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"answer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"}]}]}